  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A creature you can see within range is flooded with conflicting visions of many possible futures, and it makes an Intelligence saving throw. On a failure, it takes 12d10 Psychic damage and has Disadvantage on D20 Tests for the duration. On a success, it takes half as much damage only, and the spell ends.</p><p>At the end of each of its turns, an affected target repeats the save, ending the spell on a success.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-o6Y3AzdZjZIhQkT8\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect gives the Disadvantage on ability checks and saving throws; apply it to the target’s attack rolls by hand.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
